f the resulting girl group I.O.I. Following the dissolution of I.O.I in 2017, Chung Ha debuted as a solo artist with the extended play Hands on Me.","title":"Chung Ha","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chung_Ha"},"positions":["Main dancer","Lead vocalist"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EC%B2%AD%ED%95%98"}}},"Q27952338":{"id":"Q27952338","name":"Jung Eun-woo","ko":"정은우","birthName":"정은우","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Eunwoo"],"birth":"1998-07-01","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2012","agencies":[{"name":"Pledis Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q45282","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q54033722","name":"Pristin V","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q26265886","name":"Pristin","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q72188524","name":"HINAPIA","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/8a50dfb2-faf4-4394-8072-37e12be45497"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Eun-woo, also Eun-ooh, is a Korean given name. People with this name include: Cha Eun-woo, stage name of South Korean singer and actor Lee Dong-min Jung Eun-woo, South Korean actor Park Eun-ooh, South Korean singer Shim Eun-woo, South Korean actress","title":"Eunwoo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eunwoo"}},"Q30243794":{"id":"Q30243794","name":"Yebin","ko":"백예빈","birthName":"Baek Ye-bin","birthNameEn":"Baek Ye-bin","aliases":[],"birth":"1997-07-13","death":"","birthplace":"Chuncheon","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2015","agencies":[{"name":"MBK Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q429296","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q20733515","name":"DIA","start":"2015","end":"2022"},{"id":"Q48938270","name":"UNI.T","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yebin_o3o/","x":"https://x.com/yebin__official","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNwXf3nHC_cwG7JsfPA7FWw","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/07cc56ef-7975-4de0-8f9c-cf708ca5ad8e"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Baek Ye-bin, better known mononymously as Yebin, is a South Korean singer-songwriter and composer. She is best known for being a member of the South Korean girl group DIA, and for finishing second in the survival show The Unit, making her a member of Uni.T.","title":"Yebin (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yebin_%28singer%29"},"positions":["Main vocalist"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EC%98%88%EB%B9%88%28DIA%29"}}},"Q486610":{"id":"Q486610","name":"Lee Jang-woo","ko":"이장우","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1986-06-01","death":"","birthplace":"Mungyeong","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["film actor","singer","actor","television actor"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/palm_u_51/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/0f9dd2e6-4702-4d4d-bc8b-2562b2568268"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/190417_%EC%9D%B4%EC%9E%A5%EC%9A%B0_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:190417_%EC%9D%B4%EC%9E%A5%EC%9A%B0_(2).jpg","author":"뉴스인스타","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Lee Jang-woo is a South Korean actor and singer. He is best known for his roles in the television series Glory Jane, I Do, I Do, My Only One and Homemade Love Story. Lee also became popular after being paired with Hahm Eun-jung in the third season of fictional marriage reality show We Got Married. In 2009, Lee, No Min-woo, and Hyun Woo formed the K-pop project group 24/7, which has since disbanded after releasing the single \"24 Hours a Day, 7 Days a Week\". Lee also appeared in a 2011 music video for his cousin, singer Hwanhee.","title":"Lee Jang-woo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lee_Jang-woo"}},"Q60668946":{"id":"Q60668946","name":"Lee Eun-ju","ko":"은솜","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Eunjoo","Lee Eun Joo","Eunsom"],"birth":"1994-09-23","death":"","birthplace":"Jeonju","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q17487159","name":"Hot Place","start":"2014","end":"2014"},{"id":"Q28700240","name":"WANNA.B","start":"2015","end":""}],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q65052562":{"id":"Q65052562","name":"Lee Ru-rin","ko":"이루빈","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1995-08-16","death":"","birthplace":"Daejeon","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q63724459","name":"1Team","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/irubin_/"},"photo":null,"bio":null,"positions":["Leader","Lead vocalist"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EB%A3%A8%EB%B9%88%281TEAM%29"}}},"Q73817106":{"id":"Q73817106","name":"Royeon","ko":"로연","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Hyun Joo"],"birth":"1998-02-20","death":"","birthplace":"South Korea","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q73795501","name":"ANS","start":"2019","end":""}],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":null,"positions":["Main vocalist"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EB%A1%9C%EC%97%B0"}}},"Q78123730":{"id":"Q78123730","name":"Kim Min Kyu","ko":"김민규","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Min-kyu"],"birth":"2001-03-12","death":"","birthplace":"Ulsan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","singer"],"debut":"2019","agencies":[{"name":"Jellyfish Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q16180845","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kimminkyu_0312/","x":"https://x.com/minkyu_0312"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Min-kyu is a South Korean actor, model and singer. He has been cast in the Playlist's web drama Pop Out Boy! as the male lead Chun Nam-wook in 2020 and as Seo Ji-han in Idol: The Coup.","title":"Kim Min-kyu (entertainer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Min-kyu_%28entertainer%29"}},"Q8055186":{"id":"Q8055186","name":"Yoon Il-sang","ko":"윤일상","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1974-02-21","death":"","birthplace":"Masan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["songwriter","record producer","composer","composed musical work"],"debut":"1985","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ilsang/","x":"https://x.com/ilsang","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/6f9e3954-5b13-45f5-83bd-c9938aca946f"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Yoon Il-sang is a South Korean composer, producer, and songwriter. He graduated from Kyung Hee University Post Modern Music Department, and he is also the co-founder of Nega Network Ltd. In January 2012, Yoon released a series of digital singles to celebrate his 21st year in the music industry, collectively titled, Yoon Il Sang 21st Anniversary. \"Reminiscence\" was originally sung in 1997 by Turbo and sold 1,200,000 copies, whereas \"Remember\" was first released by DJ Doc in 1996 and sold 1,300,000 copies.","title":"Yoon Il-sang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yoon_Il-sang"}}}}